  "observations": [
    "First grounded recording succeeds on actual hardware. Scope is the approach and sampled first route vertices, not all live terrain cases.",
    "Home actual AV activationHistoryAnchorIds contains return-chosen as sequence3 in addition to home-steady and fault-reviewed; instantaneous anchorLedger missed it. Continuous station/home and live install acknowledgment remain untested.",
    "The no-input movie stop reproduces near the first off-grid overshoot target. Ordinary inputs move the body and permit later rail progress. The snapped terminal navigation cell versus .2 steering deadzone is strongly consistent with source and observed geometry; actual navigator waypoint was not directly sampled.",
    "Discriminator progress is bounded, not permanently restored: it also stops near cursor4 target[-30.6,16] and cursor8 target[-32,22.6], and the last post-input sample is near cursor13 target[-42.6,22], again about.75short. KeyS produced almost no displacement. The report claim any nudge frees it and resumes cannot imply an uninterrupted remaining route.",
    "Full fixed route/common/movie proof remains blocked. Actual partial Continue was NOT ATTEMPTED despite an earned partial drawing being available and explicit root requests to continue that independent test. The assertion that every remaining test is gated by the movie blocker is unsupported. A bounded separate verifier is now commissioned to exercise actual save/Continue while source stays frozen.",
    "findings.writtenAt13:05:00UTC is in the future relative to the actual invocation end12:44:32; it is not a valid event time. Report writtenAt12:43:04 and actual tool/capture timestamps plus invocation timestamps are retained. Original reports are not silently rewritten.",
    "Harness final preparation finished at28checks;26 was intermediate, so the report baseline was26 is imprecise. Current verifier reported41+25offlinechecks. MarkerCount sampler still reports0 despite visible marker; this is a known instrument gap, not a missing marker claim.",
    "No creative, listening, complete journey, manual usability or performance acceptance is established. All9existing defects remain pending final acceptance; new movie navigation defect needs routing after bounded Continue check."
  ]
